  "updated_at": "2026-05-08T21:11:42Z",
  "body": "> You found the only application that still needs vdpau lmao\n> \n> https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/36632\n> \n> <img alt=\"Image\" width=\"543\" height=\"173\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/36420837/589802998-0769e413-31a8-478b-8d7f-156cc52bfab2.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..RDAHqit40UX0N6GkxSc9nI9AzNSKHpd7r6bYpu5CMiE\">\n\nthat's why it's iconic and better than ruffle\n\n> Also, if I'm not mistaken setting `VDPAU_DRIVER=va_gl` only works when you install [libvdpau-va-gl](https://github.com/i-rinat/libvdpau-va-gl) which just translates vdpau to vaapi.\n\nyeah, I installed it\n\n> So this is too niche to have a dedicated fix, it should be done at the adobe flash repo instead.\n\nSad :(",
