  "body": "Meanwhile, I just globally set `VDPAU_DRIVER=va_gl` for Adobe Flash Player, it will cover most scenarios (for Nvidia if `nvidia-vaapi-driver` is installed, otherwise it fallbacks to software video decoding)",
